## Command

```shell
biome format --write file.md
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "markdown": {
    "formatter": {
      "formatEmbeds": false
    },
    "analyzeEmbeds": true
  }
}
```

## `file.md`

```md
# Embeds

```js
function () {}
```

```

